Description:It is your first main phase. You are at 20 life and control Bontu's Monument, Zulaport Cutthroat, Carrion Feeder, Gray Ogre and five Swamps, all untapped and none of them new this turn. Your hand is Unearth and Reanimate. Your graveyard holds Gravecrawler and Diregraf Colossus. The opponent is at 16 life and controls Wall of Stone and two Islands. Reduce the opponent to 0 life this turn.
Rule:authored-niche-zones-crawler | Bontu's Monument and Diregraf Colossus trigger on casting a spell (CR 601.2i, 603.2), never on a card put onto the battlefield: Gravecrawler cast from the graveyard (CR 601.3, allowed while Carrion Feeder, a Zombie, is out) drains 1 and makes a Zombie token, while Unearth or Reanimate on it would do neither; Unearth goes on Diregraf Colossus, which must be out before the first cast, and Reanimate is a trap. Wall of Stone on the Ogre leaves 1 combat damage, then 4 casts x (1 + 2 deaths) + 3 more deaths: 16
